{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o020a","title":"封孔羡宗圣侯奉孔子祀","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o020a-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"封孔羡宗圣侯奉孔子祀","evidence":["wendi-e-o020a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0014","role":"受封奉祀","evidence":["wendi-e-o020a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"颁诏","evidence":["wendi-e-o020a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":221,"label":"黄初二年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y221","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o019","basis":"黄初二年"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o020a-q","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o020a-q","source_order":[2,229,"O020a"],"order":573}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0014","name":"孔羡","evidence":["wendi-q-o020"],"facts":[{"id":"wendi-f0011","label":"世系","text":"孔子第二十一代孙","evidence":["wendi-q-b-51646f7274cac755ef42"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wendi-m-o020-wendi-p0014","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-o020"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-o020a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-0aab644d4c90a3e5d18f","layer":"original","quote":"其以议郎孔羡为宗圣侯〖16〗，邑百户，奉孔子祀。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":275,"end":299},{"id":"wendi-q-b-51646f7274cac755ef42","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-51646f7274cac755ef42","layer":"modern","quote":"〖16〗孔羡：孔子的第二十一代孙。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-935107a45e7826d05f36","start":0,"end":17},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183},{"id":"wendi-q-o020","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-0aab644d4c90a3e5d18f","layer":"original","quote":"诏曰：“昔仲尼资大圣之才〖1〗，怀帝王之器；当衰周之末，无受命之运〖2〗。在鲁、卫之朝〖3〗，教化乎洙、泗之上〖4〗。凄凄焉〖5〗，遑遑焉，欲屈己以存道，贬身以救世。于时王公，终莫能用之；乃退考五代之礼〖6〗，修素王之事〖7〗：因鲁史而制《春秋》〖8〗，就太师而正《雅》、《颂》〖9〗。俾千载之后，莫不宗其文以述作〖10〗，仰其圣以成谋。咨！可谓命世之大圣，亿载之师表者也！遭天下大乱，百祀堕坏〖11〗。旧居之庙〖12〗，毁而不修；褒成之后〖13〗，绝而莫继。阙里不闻讲颂之声〖14〗；四时不睹蒸、尝之位〖15〗。斯岂所谓崇礼报功，盛德百世必祀者哉！其以议郎孔羡为宗圣侯〖16〗，邑百户，奉孔子祀。令鲁郡修起旧庙〖17〗，置百户吏卒以守卫之〖18〗；又于其外广为室屋以居学者。”","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":339}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
